1
00:00:10,921 --> 00:00:13,721
They say the world stood shoulder to shoulder.

2
00:00:13,741 --> 00:00:15,981
I look closer - people are split apart.

3
00:00:16,462 --> 00:00:18,622
Solidarity ain’t a flag or an anthem.

4
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:21,042
It’s who stands next to you when it’s real.

5
00:00:21,662 --> 00:00:24,582
TV parades, contrails in the sky,

6
00:00:24,642 --> 00:00:27,363
Alliances line up, flags held high.

7
00:00:27,763 --> 00:00:29,823
They carve the planet into zones and deals,

8
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:32,703
I’m at the table with my son, my kin, my meals.

9
00:00:33,303 --> 00:00:35,443
NATO thunders, dollar takes flight,

10
00:00:36,063 --> 00:00:38,044
But my house stands firm through the night.

11
00:00:38,564 --> 00:00:40,524
They draw blocks on a global map,

12
00:00:40,624 --> 00:00:42,684
I build love between windows and cracks.

13
00:00:42,924 --> 00:00:44,984
My union ain’t written in ink,

14
00:00:45,104 --> 00:00:47,844
It’s in the eyes that don’t blink in the freeze.

15
00:00:47,884 --> 00:00:50,845
Atlantic, East - those lines don’t apply,

16
00:00:50,945 --> 00:00:54,465
If your heart’s with mine, my world stands high.

17
00:00:54,865 --> 00:00:58,745
If your heart’s with mine...

18
00:00:58,945 --> 00:01:09,186
my world stands high...

19
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:13,167
They call it “solidarity,” I call it disguise,

20
00:01:13,427 --> 00:01:15,847
A safety mask worn over tired lies.

21
00:01:15,947 --> 00:01:18,247
Every war got hands behind the scene,

22
00:01:18,267 --> 00:01:21,148
Funny how often they’re from the same machine.

23
00:01:21,228 --> 00:01:23,908
I don’t trust flags, I trust the stare,

24
00:01:24,128 --> 00:01:26,488
Who stayed with me when hell was there.

25
00:01:26,848 --> 00:01:29,648
My brother didn’t fold, my family spoke,

26
00:01:29,708 --> 00:01:31,708
Friends went broke - still the soul stayed woke.

27
00:01:31,748 --> 00:01:33,409
My union ain’t written in ink,

28
00:01:33,629 --> 00:01:36,729
It’s in the eyes that don’t blink in the freeze.

29
00:01:37,289 --> 00:01:39,689
Atlantic, East - those lines don’t apply,

30
00:01:39,709 --> 00:01:42,449
If your heart’s with mine, my world stands high.

31
00:01:42,469 --> 00:01:46,970
If your heart’s with mine...

32
00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:58,631
my world stands high...

33
00:01:59,151 --> 00:02:01,691
Politics buzzing, numbers, noise,

34
00:02:01,971 --> 00:02:04,192
We stand like a bridge with no other choice.

35
00:02:04,212 --> 00:02:06,972
I don’t chase loans from a чужой elite,

36
00:02:07,012 --> 00:02:09,512
My faith hits harder than their biggest beat.

37
00:02:09,772 --> 00:02:12,432
The world sells brotherhood for oil and gas,

38
00:02:12,492 --> 00:02:15,093
We break bread even when times don’t last.

39
00:02:15,433 --> 00:02:17,853
Where lies fly fast through cables and feeds,

40
00:02:18,313 --> 00:02:20,453
Truth speaks low - through common streets.

41
00:02:20,613 --> 00:02:23,273
When the noise cuts out, you hear the breath,

42
00:02:23,713 --> 00:02:26,034
Family and friends - that’s life, not death.

43
00:02:26,114 --> 00:02:28,974
Their union’s paper, slogans and plans,

44
00:02:29,534 --> 00:02:31,474
Ours is memory, soul, and hands.

45
00:02:31,554 --> 00:02:33,954
As long as my brother stands, family near,

46
00:02:34,014 --> 00:02:36,815
No global “solidarity” replaces you here.

47
00:02:36,935 --> 00:02:40,055
Let the flags burn down, that’s not the end -

48
00:02:40,095 --> 00:02:40,935
We’ll still remain.

49
00:02:40,955 --> 00:02:41,655
That’s permanent.

